1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,120
Section 1

2
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:03,770
ANGELA:

3
00:00:03,770 --> 00:00:05,740
Hello, Flanders conference hotel.

4
00:00:05,740 --> 00:00:06,322
MAN:

5
00:00:06,322 --> 00:00:06,784
Oh, hi.

6
00:00:06,784 --> 00:00:10,600
I wanted to ask about conference facilities at the hotel.

7
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:13,590
Have l come through to the right person?

8
00:00:13,590 --> 00:00:14,090
ANGELA:

9
00:00:14,090 --> 00:00:15,090
You have.

10
00:00:15,090 --> 00:00:17,590
I'm the customer services manager.

11
00:00:17,590 --> 00:00:19,090
My name's Angela.

12
00:00:19,090 --> 00:00:22,090
So how can I help you?

13
00:00:22,090 --> 00:00:22,513
MAN:

14
00:00:22,513 --> 00:00:28,430
Well, l'm calling from Barrett and Stansons, we're a medical company based in Perth.

15
00:00:28,430 --> 00:00:29,110
ANGELA:

16
00:00:29,110 --> 00:00:30,470
Oh yes.

17
00:00:30,470 --> 00:00:30,846
MAN:

18
00:00:30,846 --> 00:00:35,730
And we're organising a conference for our clients to be held in Sydney.

19
00:00:35,730 --> 00:00:40,990
It'll be held over two days and we're expecting about fifty or sixty people.

20
00:00:40,990 --> 00:00:41,376
ANGELA:

21
00:00:41,376 --> 00:00:44,080
When were you thinking of having it?

22
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:44,494
MAN:

23
00:00:44,494 --> 00:00:48,629
Some time early next year, like the end of January?

24
00:00:48,629 --> 00:00:51,110
lt'd have to be a weekend.

25
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:51,686
ANGELA:

26
00:00:51,686 --> 00:00:53,415
Let me see...

27
00:00:53,415 --> 00:01:00,330
our conference facilities are already booked for the weekend beginning January 28th.

28
00:01:00,330 --> 00:01:04,940
We could do the first weekend in February?

29
00:01:04,940 --> 00:01:05,716
MAN:

30
00:01:05,716 --> 00:01:08,820
How about January 21st?

31
00:01:08,820 --> 00:01:09,638
ANGELA:

32
00:01:09,638 --> 00:01:13,730
I'm afraid that's booked too.

33
00:01:13,730 --> 00:01:14,186
MAN:

34
00:01:14,186 --> 00:01:17,830
Well, let's go for the February date then.

35
00:01:17,830 --> 00:01:18,424
ANGELA:

36
00:01:18,424 --> 00:01:22,580
So that's the weekend beginning the 4th.

37
00:01:22,580 --> 00:01:23,053
MAN:

38
00:01:23,053 --> 00:01:23,525
OK.

39
00:01:23,525 --> 00:01:29,670
Now can you tell me a bit about what conference facilities you have?

40
00:01:29,670 --> 00:01:30,272
ANGELA:

41
00:01:30,272 --> 00:01:30,873
Sure.

42
00:01:30,873 --> 00:01:36,890
So for talks and presentations we have the Tesla room.

43
00:01:36,890 --> 00:01:37,765
MAN:

44
00:01:37,765 --> 00:01:38,640
Sorry?

45
00:01:38,640 --> 00:01:39,274
ANGELA:

46
00:01:39,274 --> 00:01:41,808
Tesla - that's spelled T-E-S-L-A.

47
00:01:41,808 --> 00:01:46,244
It holds up to a hundred people,

48
00:01:46,244 --> 00:01:52,580
and it's fully equipped with a projector and so on.

49
00:01:52,580 --> 00:01:53,120
MAN:

50
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:55,280
How about a microphone?

51
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:55,662
ANGELA:

52
00:01:55,662 --> 00:01:56,043
Yes,

53
00:01:56,043 --> 00:01:59,095
that'll be all set up ready for you,

54
00:01:59,095 --> 00:02:04,437
and there'll be one that members of the audience can use too, for questions,

55
00:02:04,437 --> 00:02:05,200
if necessary.

56
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:05,560
MAN:

57
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:05,920
Fine.

58
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:10,597
And we'll also need some sort of open area where people can sit

59
00:02:10,597 --> 00:02:12,755
and have a cup of coffee,

60
00:02:12,755 --> 00:02:16,353
and we'd like to have an exhibition of our products

61
00:02:16,353 --> 00:02:18,152
and services there as well,

62
00:02:18,152 --> 00:02:21,390
so that'll need to be quite a big space.

63
00:02:21,390 --> 00:02:21,839
ANGELA:

64
00:02:21,839 --> 00:02:26,332
That's fine, there's a central atrium with all those facilities,

65
00:02:26,332 --> 00:02:32,621
and you can come before the conference starts if you want to set everything

66
00:02:32,621 --> 00:02:33,070
up.

67
00:02:33,070 --> 00:02:33,691
MAN:

68
00:02:33,691 --> 00:02:34,313
Great.

69
00:02:34,313 --> 00:02:37,420
And I presume there's wifi?

70
00:02:37,420 --> 00:02:38,020
ANGELA:

71
00:02:38,020 --> 00:02:39,220
Oh, yes,

72
00:02:39,220 --> 00:02:43,420
that's free and available throughout the hotel.

73
00:02:43,420 --> 00:02:44,470
MAN:

74
00:02:44,470 --> 00:02:45,520
OK.

75
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:45,895
ANGELA:

76
00:02:45,895 --> 00:02:49,643
Would you also like us to provide a buffet lunch?

77
00:02:49,643 --> 00:02:54,140
We can do a two-course meal with a number of different options.

78
00:02:54,140 --> 00:02:54,492
MAN:

79
00:02:54,492 --> 00:02:58,010
What sort of price are we looking at for that?

80
00:02:58,010 --> 00:02:58,518
ANGELA:

81
00:02:58,518 --> 00:03:04,106
Well, I can send you a copy of the standard menu.

82
00:03:04,106 --> 00:03:06,138
That's $45 per person.

83
00:03:06,138 --> 00:03:10,710
Or you can have the special for $25 more.

84
00:03:10,710 --> 00:03:11,133
MAN:

85
00:03:11,133 --> 00:03:14,093
I think the standard should be ok,

86
00:03:14,093 --> 00:03:16,630
but yes, send me the menu.

87
00:03:16,630 --> 00:03:17,016
MAN:

88
00:03:17,016 --> 00:03:22,427
Now we're also going to need accommodation on the Saturday night for some of

89
00:03:22,427 --> 00:03:23,200
the participants...

90
00:03:23,200 --> 00:03:25,132
l'm not sure how many,

91
00:03:25,132 --> 00:03:26,678
but probably about 25.

92
00:03:26,678 --> 00:03:29,770
So what do you charge for a room?

93
00:03:29,770 --> 00:03:30,435
ANGELA:

94
00:03:30,435 --> 00:03:36,422
Well, for conference attendees we have a 25% reduction,

95
00:03:36,422 --> 00:03:41,744
so we can offer you rooms at $135.

96
00:03:41,744 --> 00:03:45,070
Normally a standard room's $180.

97
00:03:45,070 --> 00:03:45,578
MAN:

98
00:03:45,578 --> 00:03:48,120
And does that include breakfast?

99
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:48,498
ANGELA:

100
00:03:48,498 --> 00:03:48,876
Sure.

101
00:03:48,876 --> 00:03:54,169
And of course, guests can also make use of all the other facilities at

102
00:03:54,169 --> 00:03:54,925
the hotel.

103
00:03:54,925 --> 00:03:59,839
So we've got a spa where you can get massages and facials and

104
00:03:59,839 --> 00:04:00,595
so on,

105
00:04:00,595 --> 00:04:05,510
and there's a pool up on the roof for the use of guests.

106
00:04:05,510 --> 00:04:06,152
MAN:

107
00:04:06,152 --> 00:04:06,793
Great.

108
00:04:06,793 --> 00:04:10,002
Now what about transport links?

109
00:04:10,002 --> 00:04:13,210
The hotel's downtown, isn't it?

110
00:04:13,210 --> 00:04:13,652
ANGELA:

111
00:04:13,652 --> 00:04:17,186
Yes, it's about 12 kilometres from the airport,

112
00:04:17,186 --> 00:04:20,719
but there's a complimentary shuttle bus for guests.

113
00:04:20,719 --> 00:04:26,020
And it's only about ten minutes' walk from the central railway station.

114
00:04:26,020 --> 00:04:26,389
MAN:

115
00:04:26,389 --> 00:04:26,757
OK.

116
00:04:26,757 --> 00:04:31,918
Now, I don't know Sydney very well, can you just give me an idea

117
00:04:31,918 --> 00:04:34,130
of the location of the hotel?

118
00:04:34,130 --> 00:04:34,514
ANGELA:

119
00:04:34,514 --> 00:04:36,817
Well, it's downtown on Wilby Street,

120
00:04:36,817 --> 00:04:38,736
that's quite a small street,

121
00:04:38,736 --> 00:04:41,807
and it's not very far from the sea.

122
00:04:41,807 --> 00:04:47,180
And of course if the conference attendees want to go out on the Saturday

123
00:04:47,180 --> 00:04:50,635
evening there's a huge choice of places to eat.

124
00:04:50,635 --> 00:04:56,009
Then if they want to make a night of it, they can go on

125
00:04:56,009 --> 00:05:00,998
to one of the clubs in the area - there are a great many

126
00:05:00,998 --> 00:05:02,150
to choose from.

127
00:05:02,150 --> 00:05:02,614
MAN:

128
00:05:02,614 --> 00:05:03,078
OK.

129
00:05:03,078 --> 00:05:09,572
So if we go ahead with this, can you give me some information about

130
00:05:09,572 --> 00:05:10,500
how much…
